Upstream source of the Shikra R7RS conformance suite
====================================================

r7rs-tests.scm in this directory is an unmodified copy of Chibi Scheme's
R7RS test suite.

  Repository: https://github.com/ashinn/chibi-scheme
  File:       tests/r7rs-tests.scm
  Fetched from the master branch at commit
              9b0c19aa2eb92e3652f02c782c2e29f3672b40f6 (2026-11-18)
  URL:        https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ashinn/chibi-scheme/9b0c19aa2eb92e3652f02c782c2e29f3672b40f6/tests/r7rs-tests.scm
  Last commit touching the file: 18e561eea6f219b4676f45b522591979c923740f
  SHA-256:    c1ef92910e70d469745a7b779658796767c1f97f7fea16a190305e396685d779

The adapted per-library programs in tests/r7rs/*.scm are derived from this
file; see ../EXCLUSIONS.md for every change. The (chibi test) library in
../chibi/test.sld is an independent, portable re-implementation of the
interface that upstream's lib/chibi/test.sld provides (that file was used
as a reference only; no code was copied from it).

